{"version":1,"key":"card:243","content":{"id":243,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合提供 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"forEach","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 API 让我们来遍历 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"forEach","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接收一个回调函数，该回调函数接收三个参数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"集合中的元素"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"键值，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合没有键，因此该值与第一个参数的值相同"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合本身"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let set = new Set();\n\nset.add(1);\nset.add(3);\nset.add(4);\n\nset.forEach((value, _, ownerSet) => {\n  console.log(value);  // 1\n                       // 3\n                       // 4\n  console.assert(ownerSet === set);\n});","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d5ba66af-1e5c-4144-ad6c-daf1bea64c75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果需要在回调函数中使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"this","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的话，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"forEach","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的第二个参数将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"this","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传入"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let set = new Set([1, 2]);\n\nlet processor = {\n  output(value) {\n    console.log(value);\n  },\n  process(dataSet) {\n    dataSet.forEach((value) => {\n      this.output(value);\n    }, this);\n  },\n};\n\nprocessor.process(set);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"71827c7a-7306-4c52-83be-18b398779d86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Set"],"createTime":1690984024894,"updateTime":1743303640412,"linkedCards":[{"id":242,"target":{"key":"card:242","type":"card","id":242},"summary":"Set 集合是一个有序的、没有重复元素的集合。通过 new Set() 得到一个 Set 对象， Set 集合提供如下 API add(item) ：向集合中添加元素 item has(item) ：判断集合中是否有 item 元素 del...","tags":["JavaScript/Set"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640412}}